0e9 \u2013 vy\u017eaduje platebn\u00ed kartu)"],"Mapbox makes Leaflet even better, with great-looking map tiles, styled maps, and a powerful geocoder.":["Mapbox d\u011bl\u00e1 Leaflet je\u0161t\u011b lep\u0161\u00edm: kr\u00e1sn\u00e9 mapov\u00e9 dla\u017edice, stylovan\u00e9 mapy a v\u00fdkonn\u00fd geokod\u00e9r."],"A generous monthly usage credit means it's free for most sites.":["D\u00edky \u0161t\u011bdr\u00e9mu m\u011bs\u00ed\u010dn\u00edmu kreditu je to pro v\u011bt\u0161inu web\u016f zdarma."],"Get Mapbox Access Token":["Z\u00edskat p\u0159\u00edstupov\u00fd token Mapbox"],"Enter your access token here":["Sem zadejte sv\u016fj p\u0159\u00edstupov\u00fd token"],"Maps in the Block Editor":["Mapy v blokov\u00e9m editoru"],"MapPress provides custom block types for the Gutenberg editor.":["MapPress nab\u00edz\u00ed vlastn\u00ed typy blok\u016f pro editor Gutenberg."],"Just insert a MapPress Map block to get started.":["Pro za\u010d\u00e1tek sta\u010d\u00ed vlo\u017eit blok Mapa MapPress."],"Maps in the Classic Editor":["Mapy v klasick\u00e9m editoru"],"MapPress also supports the \"classic\" editor.  Just click the MapPress button to open the map library.":["MapPress podporuje i \u201eklasick\u00fd\u201c editor.  Sta\u010d\u00ed kliknout na tla\u010d\u00edtko MapPress a otev\u0159e se knihovna map."],"The Map Library provides an easy way to see and edit all of your maps.  The library can be opened in the post editor or from the MapPress menu.":["V knihovn\u011b map snadno zobraz\u00edte a uprav\u00edte v\u0161echny sv\u00e9 mapy.  Knihovnu otev\u0159ete v editoru p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016f nebo z menu MapPress."],"Happy Mapping":["P\u0159\u00edjemn\u00e9 mapov\u00e1n\u00ed"],"Enjoy the plugin!  Replay this guide any time from the MapPress support menu.":["U\u017eijte si plugin!  Tohoto pr\u016fvodce m\u016f\u017eete kdykoli znovu spustit z menu podpory MapPress."],"Welcome to MapPress!":["V\u00edtejte v MapPress!"],"Map popup":["Vyskakovac\u00ed okno mapy"],"Map list item":["Polo\u017eka seznamu mapy"],"Mashup popup":["Vyskakovac\u00ed okno mashupu"],"Mashup list item":["Polo\u017eka seznamu mashupu"],"User popup":["Vyskakovac\u00ed okno u\u017eivatele"],"User list item":["Polo\u017eka seznamu u\u017eivatele"],"New":["Nov\u00fd"],"Editor":["Editor"],"Reset template to default":["Obnovit v\u00fdchoz\u00ed \u0161ablonu"],"This basemap needs WebGL, which is disabled in this browser. Enable hardware acceleration (e.g. Chrome: Settings \u2192 System \u2192 \"Use hardware acceleration when available\"), then reload.":["Tato podkladov\u00e1 mapa vy\u017eaduje WebGL, kter\u00e9 je v tomto prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010di vypnut\u00e9. Zapn\u011bte hardwarovou akceleraci (nap\u0159. Chrome: Nastaven\u00ed \u2192 Syst\u00e9m \u2192 \u201ePou\u017e\u00edvat grafickou akceleraci, je-li k dispozici\u201c) a str\u00e1nku znovu na\u010dt\u011bte."],"A cookie-consent or script-optimization plugin is probably blocking it.":["Pravd\u011bpodobn\u011b jej blokuje plugin pro souhlas s cookies nebo pro optimalizaci skript\u016f."],"The Leaflet library (leaflet.js) was not loaded":["Knihovna Leaflet (leaflet.js) nebyla na\u010dtena"],"The MapLibre GL library (maplibre-gl.js) was not loaded":["Knihovna MapLibre GL (maplibre-gl.js) nebyla na\u010dtena"],"The MapLibre GL Leaflet plugin (leaflet-maplibre-gl.js) was not loaded, or ran before leaflet.js":["Plugin MapLibre GL pro Leaflet (leaflet-maplibre-gl.js) nebyl na\u010dten nebo se spustil p\u0159ed leaflet.js"],"Toggle fullscreen view":["P\u0159epnout na celou obrazovku"],"Your Location":["Va\u0161e poloha"],"Browser does not support geolocation":["Prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010d nepodporuje zji\u0161\u0165ov\u00e1n\u00ed polohy"],"Unable to get your location":["Nepoda\u0159ilo se zjistit va\u0161i polohu"],"The map could not be displayed.":["Mapu se nepoda\u0159ilo zobrazit."],"How to fix this":["Jak to opravit"],"Only administrators see this message. Full details are in the browser console.":["Tuto zpr\u00e1vu vid\u00ed jen administr\u00e1to\u0159i. V\u0161echny podrobnosti jsou v konzoli prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010de."],"Add address, lat\/lng or KML\/GPX URL":["P\u0159idat adresu, lat\/lng nebo URL KML\/GPX"],"MapPress map error":["Chyba mapy MapPress"],"This map needs WebGL, which is disabled in this browser":["Tato mapa vy\u017eaduje WebGL, kter\u00e9 je v tomto prohl\u00ed\u017ee\u010di vypnut\u00e9"],"Enable hardware acceleration (e.g. Chrome: Settings \u2192 System \u2192 \"Use hardware acceleration when available\"), then reload.":["Zapn\u011bte hardwarovou akceleraci (nap\u0159. Chrome: Nastaven\u00ed \u2192 Syst\u00e9m \u2192 \u201ePou\u017e\u00edvat grafickou akceleraci, je-li k dispozici\u201c) a str\u00e1nku znovu na\u010dt\u011bte."],"The Mapbox GL library (mapbox-gl.js) was not loaded":["Knihovna Mapbox GL (mapbox-gl.js) nebyla na\u010dtena"],"A Mapbox access token is required":["Je vy\u017eadov\u00e1n p\u0159\u00edstupov\u00fd token Mapbox"],"Mapbox GL needs a token even with OpenFreeMap tiles.  Enter one in the MapPress settings.":["Mapbox GL vy\u017eaduje token i s dla\u017edicemi OpenFreeMap.  Zadejte jej v nastaven\u00ed MapPress."],"Traffic":["Doprava"],"Bicycling":["Cyklistika"],"Transit":["Hromadn\u00e1 doprava"],"Center map":["Vycentrovat mapu"],"%d of %d":["%d z %d"],"Enter an address, place, KML URL, or lat,lng":["Zadejte adresu, m\u00edsto, URL KML nebo lat,lng"],"Enter an address, place or lat,lng":["Zadejte adresu, m\u00edsto nebo lat,lng"],"Error reading KML or GPX file.":["Chyba p\u0159i \u010dten\u00ed souboru KML nebo GPX."],"If the file is on another domain, this may be a CORS restriction.  See the MapPress FAQ for help.":["Pokud je soubor na jin\u00e9 dom\u00e9n\u011b, m\u016f\u017ee j\u00edt o omezen\u00ed CORS.  N\u00e1pov\u011bdu najdete v \u010dast\u00fdch dotazech MapPress."]}}}